 po bode — 74-bodový voľný pracovný list"}],["$","meta","47",{"property":"og:description","content":"Levíčatá mňaukajú, kým sa nenaučia hromžiť. Vytvarujte mladého leva cez 74 bodov s týmto voľným tlačiteľným pracovným listom pre deti vo veku 5–9 rokov."}],["$","meta","48",{"property":"og:url","content":"https://dottodotfreeprintables.com/sk/cute/cute-lion-dot-to-dot-puzzle/"}],["$","meta","49",{"property":"og:site_name","content":"DotToDotFreePrintables.com"}],["$","meta","50",{"property":"og:type","content":"article"}],["$","meta","51",{"name":"twitter:card","content":"summary"}],["$","meta","52",{"name":"twitter:title","content":"Roztomilý levíča bod po bode — 74-bodový voľný pracovný list"}],["$","meta","53",{"name":"twitter:description","content":"Levíčatá mňaukajú, kým sa nenaučia hromžiť. Vytvarujte mladého leva cez 74 bodov s týmto voľným tlačiteľným pracovným listom pre deti vo veku 5–9 rokov."}],["$","link","54",{"rel":"icon","href":"/favicon.ico?v=previous-dot-icon"}],["$","link","55",{"rel":"icon","href":"/favicon.svg?v=previous-dot-icon","type":"image/svg+xml"}],["$","link","56",{"rel":"icon","href":"/favicon-16x16.png?v=previous-dot-icon","sizes":"16x16","type":"image/png"}],["$","link","57",{"rel":"icon","href":"/favicon-32x32.png?v=previous-dot-icon","sizes":"32x32","type":"image/png"}],["$","link","58",{"rel":"apple-touch-icon","href":"/apple-touch-icon.png?v=previous-dot-icon","sizes":"180x180","type":"image/png"}],["$","link","59",{"rel":"icon","href":"/icon-192.png?v=previous-dot-icon","sizes":"192x192","type":"image/png"}],["$","link","60",{"rel":"icon","href":"/icon-512.png?v=previous-dot-icon","sizes":"512x512","type":"image/png"}]]
